---
description: Update canonical docs in the same change when documented behaviour changes
alwaysApply: true
---

If an implementation change alters approved behavior, architecture, API usage, routes, schemas, or UX, update the affected canonical documentation in the same change.

Do not edit docs for implementation-only changes that do not affect documented behavior.

Remove stale statements caused by the change before completion.

Do not rewrite `docs/archive/**`.
